    "Stem": "Flash Holdings plans a $12,000,000 bond issue priced at 97.5% of par (net proceeds after flotation), with a 6.0% coupon paid annually and a yield to maturity of 6.5%. The tax rate is 30%. Treasurer Maya Caldwell asks for the after-tax cost of debt. What is the after-tax cost of debt?",
