    "Stem": "Meridian Corp is considering acquiring Harbor Industries for $850 million. Harbor's standalone value is $720 million, and Meridian's cost of capital is 10%. The acquisition is expected to generate cost synergies for 10 years. What is the minimum annual cost synergy required to justify the acquisition premium?",
