    "LOSTag": "B.8",
    "Part2OnlyFlag": true,
    "Stem": "Pinnacle Industries is evaluating the acquisition of Vector Manufacturing for $520 million in cash. Vector's standalone value is $440 million, and the present value of expected synergies is $100 million. Pinnacle's cost of capital is 11%, and acquisition-related costs are $8 million. What is the NPV of the acquisition to Pinnacle?",
    "Choices": {
      "A": "$80 million",
      "B": "$20 million",
      "C": "$12 million",
      "D": "-$8 million"
    },
